16:["$","footer",null,{"className":"site-footer","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"shell footer-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"className":"brand footer-brand","href":"/","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"brand-logo brand-logo-dark","src":"/Logos/OW%20web%20desktop%20logos%20(200%20x%2040%20px)/OW%20White%20Logo%20desktop.png","alt":"One Window"}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Expert guidance and technology for your study abroad journey."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Explore"}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/#destinations","children":"Study destinations"}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/countries","children":"Universities"}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/#consultation","children":"Course guidance"}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/careers","children":"Careers"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Connect"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://onewindow.co/contact/","children":"Contact"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:info@onewindow.co","children":"Email us"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://onewindow.co/privacy-policy/","children":"Privacy policy"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"shell footer-bottom","children":"© One Window. All rights reserved."}]]}]
17:["$","p","Work experience:",{"children":"Work experience:"}]
18:["$","p","Gaining work experience during your study gap can significantly enhance your application to UK universities. Make sure to have all your work experience certificates and documents to make your application process easier.",{"children":"Gaining work experience during your study gap can significantly enhance your application to UK universities. Make sure to have all your work experience certificates and documents to make your application process easier."}]
19:["$","p","Short Courses:",{"children":"Short Courses:"}]
1a:["$","p","Many students start doing short courses after their secondary education, which is again an advantage for applicants with a study gap. To enter the gates of UK universities, you must provide a certificate of the short courses you completed while applying to the universities.",{"children":"Many students start doing short courses after their secondary education, which is again an advantage for applicants with a study gap. To enter the gates of UK universities, you must provide a certificate of the short courses you completed while applying to the universities."}]
1b:["$","p","Health Issues:",{"children":"Health Issues:"}]
1c:["$","p","These are students who have medical conditions that prevent them from taking a break from their further studies. There is no need to worry about the study gap while applying to UK universities for health-related reasons. If you provide all the necessary documents and health certificates related to your treatment, your current health condition, and a fit-to-certificate, it will make your application process more understandable, especially when considering your study gap.",{"children":"These are students who have medical conditions that prevent them from taking a break from their further studies. There is no need to worry about the study gap while applying to UK universities for health-related reasons. If you provide all the necessary documents and health certificates related to your treatment, your current health condition, and a fit-to-certificate, it will make your application process more understandable, especially when considering your study gap."}]
1d:["$","p","Financial issues:",{"children":"Financial issues:"}]
1e:["$","p","Students facing financial crises and family issues are also eligible for the study gap visa in the UK. To ensure consideration, the applicant must clearly explain the issues to the immigration officer.",{"children":"Students facing financial crises and family issues are also eligible for the study gap visa in the UK. To ensure consideration, the applicant must clearly explain the issues to the immigration officer."}]
1f:["$","p","The top 10 universities allow study gaps:",{"children":"The top 10 universities allow study gaps:"}]
20:["$","p","Many universities in the UK allow for study gaps. Here is a list of the few universities that do so:",{"children":"Many universities in the UK allow for study gaps. Here is a list of the few universities that do so:"}]
